{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/init()"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/body(content:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents24OUDSLegacyLayoutModifierV","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"code":"ViewModifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 27 for iOS 27, Liquid Glass is forced by the system and considered as enabled by OUDS."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 26, the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" flag is read and OUDS considers wether or not Liquid Glass is enabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If an app is compiled with Xcode 26 for iOS 18 and lower, Liquid Glass is considered as unavailable, disabled."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The edge case is when the OS version is 27, the flag "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stils exists but the app is compiled with Xcode 26."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This case is extreme: the system does not force Liquid Glass, the flag is here, and OUDS cannot only rely on the OS version."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thus, this "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"  will define an environment value saying any legacy layout things (appearances, selector, divider) must be displayed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"**You must use this "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"type":"text","text":" with care, and only if you are using Xcode 26 and  "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to YES **."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Prefer build with Xcode 27 without the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"UIDesignRequiresCompatibility"}]},{"type":"text","text":"  flag."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["  OUDSTabBar(selectedTab: ..., count: ...) { ... )","    .modifier(OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier())"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note: You should use this view modifier in your root view because the flag it defines in deeper levels is used for all navigations components like bars","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"Since","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"title":"Components","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier":{"role":"symbol","title":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslegacylayoutmodifier","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLegacyLayoutModifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifier"},{"text":" to manage an edge case about Liquid Glass configuration of Apple OS and Xcode versions.","type":"text"}],"na